Acknowledgements
----------------
Terraformation is a serverless, AWS-only successor in spirit to Terraboard
(https://github.com/camptocamp/terraboard), Copyright Camptocamp SA and
contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Terraboard was studied as a functional and behavioural reference (state
parsing, storage model, state comparison, search and REST API semantics,
packages state/, db/, compare/, api/ and types/). No Terraboard source code or
architecture is reused: this project is a clean re-implementation in Python
(Pydantic, FastAPI) on AWS serverless services, and a Flutter web frontend.
The original Go sources remain available in the git history of this
repository for reference.
